project (cv, ov, pv) (rows≈11 cost≈10.6K)
└─ join inner [p.pk = o.flag] (rows≈11 cost≈10.4K)
   ├─ filter (== |p.pv| 1) (rows≈2 cost≈192)
   │  └─ source p AS p row-groups (== |p.pv| 1) (rows≈6 cost≈96)
   └─ join inner [o.ok = c.ck] (rows≈11 cost≈5.4K)
      ├─ source o AS o (rows≈20 cost≈480)
      └─ source c AS c (rows≈8 cost≈128)
